    "aiDescription": {
      "summary": "Directs the GAO to study and report within 18 months how Federal reductions in force affect State and local budgets, revenues, services, and regional economies. It covers RIFs under title 5 and other significant federal civilian downsizings, and effects on States, the District of Columbia, territories, possessions, and local governments.",
