    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill directs the GAO to study how Federal RIFs affect State and local budgets, including unemployment insurance, Medicaid, retraining, housing, and tax revenues. GAO will consult OPM, the Department of Labor, state budget officers and governors, and report findings to House and Senate committees.",
